 |  NAME
 |    devtostream
 |  PURPOSE
 |    dump all data on a device to a stream.
 |
 |  NOTES
 |    only works for RDB partitions.
 |
 |  COPYRIGHT
 |    Copyright (C) 1993  Christian E. Hopps
